 </p>
 <h3><a name="exec">XIII. Creating executable files</a></h3>
@@ -978,8 +978,9 @@ format elfobj64<br>
 <p>Black = 1 byte. <span class="blue">Blue = 4 bytes = data.</span> <span class="red">Red = string = data[+byte(s)].</span> <span class="green">Green = replacement.</span></p>
 <p>There are at least two options at the '*' wildcard from there. '{}' is an enumeration.</p>
 <p>First long(4 bytes) is null or offset of entry which will be at the end.</p>
+<p>Xfile_noignore at ocompiler is ^ sign before the command, and at otoc will noignore a tagIgnore argument.</p>
